Big elephants get clean, too.

00:52:10.300 --> 00:52:13.320
Now a red elephant and the mouse dance under a raining cloud.

00:52:13.320 --> 00:52:21.480
Oy, she's sleeping in the shower.

00:52:30.600 --> 00:52:43.190
now the bathtub and elmo by the piano yes there's nothing like singing to keep

00:52:43.190 --> 00:52:52.570
the pipes from rusting the bath time song oh that makes me feel a warm and

00:52:52.570 --> 00:52:58.290
bubbly yeah elmo plays the piano

00:53:00.090 --> 00:53:26.300
Elmo dances.

00:53:49.100 --> 00:53:52.080
Now, Slimy wearing pajamas lies beside a small bed.

00:53:52.160 --> 00:53:54.160
Okay, okay, Slimy, I'll read to you.

00:53:54.360 --> 00:53:56.040
Just don't say please, okay?

00:53:57.320 --> 00:53:58.540
All right, little guy.

00:53:59.060 --> 00:53:59.540
Here we go.

00:54:00.380 --> 00:54:05.580
Chapter 453 in The Adventures of Trash Gordon.

00:54:05.580 --> 00:54:07.480
Oscar reads:

00:54:07.480 --> 00:54:11.820
We last left our hero, Trash Gordon, on the planet Mud,

00:54:11.820 --> 00:54:14.700
being attacked by the muddy Mudons.

00:54:14.700 --> 00:54:18.430
He moved to the right, then to the left,

00:54:18.430 --> 00:54:21.750
then he had a great idea.

00:54:21.750 --> 00:54:25.190
He reached for their favorite dessert,

00:54:25.190 --> 00:54:27.550
apple pie a la Mud.

00:54:27.550 --> 00:54:30.000
The furry Mudons take the pie.

00:54:30.320 --> 00:54:32.320
Grunk, grunk, grunk.

00:54:32.320 --> 00:54:34.320
Grunk, grunk, grunk.

00:54:34.320 --> 00:54:36.320
Then Trash broke claims proudly.

00:54:36.320 --> 00:54:38.320
Trash smiles.

00:54:38.320 --> 00:54:42.150
Sesame Street hasn't brought you today by the letter B.

00:54:42.150 --> 00:54:44.150
The big red letter B appears. By the number A.

00:54:44.150 --> 00:54:46.150
The red number eight appears.

00:54:46.150 --> 00:54:50.150
The bald Trash Gordon stands with his hands on his hips, his cape flapping in the breeze.

00:54:50.150 --> 00:54:52.150
Now Slimy lies in bed.

00:54:52.150 --> 00:54:57.810
Now, no more now, Slimy. That's all for now.

00:54:57.810 --> 00:55:00.000
It's time for you to get some shut-eye, little guy.

00:55:00.510 --> 00:55:02.230
We'll read some more trash tomorrow.

00:55:02.530 --> 00:55:04.130
Slimy snuggles under the covers.

00:55:04.470 --> 00:55:05.570
Oscar glances up.

00:55:07.490 --> 00:55:08.550
Hey, are you still here?

00:55:08.940 --> 00:55:12.660
I told you, no more trash, Gordon, until tomorrow.

